{"decisions":[{"id":"components.MagazineDetails.viewRequest","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MagazineDetails.watchlistDeleted","verdict":"correct","target":"<strong>{title}</strong> eliminado de la lista de seguimiento con éxito.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Lista de vigilancia' is a literal translation of 'watchlist' but 'lista de seguimiento' is the standard UI term in Spanish for media apps. 'Quitado' is informal; 'eliminado' is more appropriate for a system action. The exclamation mark is unnecessary in formal UI Spanish."},{"id":"components.MagazineDetails.watchlistError","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.MagazineDetails.watchlistSuccess","verdict":"correct","target":"<strong>{title}</strong> añadido a la lista de seguimiento con éxito.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Correctamente' is a calque of 'successfully'; 'con éxito' is the natural Spanish phrasing. 'Lista de seguimiento' is consistent with the corrected 'watchlistDeleted' term."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.alreadyBlocklisted","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.audiobook","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.block","verdict":"correct","target":"Bloquear título","confidence":"high","reason":"'Título del bloque' is a mistranslation of 'Blocklist Title' (which means 'Title to be blocklisted'). 'Bloquear título' is the correct imperative action label."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.blockConfirm","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.blockDescription","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.blocklist","verdict":"correct","target":"Lista de bloqueo","confidence":"high","reason":"'Bloqueo' is a noun referring to the act of blocking, but 'Lista de bloqueo' is the standard term for 'Blocklist' in UI contexts, consistent with other strings in this set."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.blocklistCheckFailed","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.blocklistPermission","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.both","verdict":"correct","target":"Libro y Audiolibro","confidence":"high","reason":"The source 'Book and Audiobook' uses singular nouns. The target 'Libro y Audiolibros' incorrectly pluralizes 'Audiolibros'. It should be 'Libro y Audiolibro' to match the source and standard UI phrasing."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.cancel","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.checkingBlocklist","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.checkingLibraries","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.clearStaleAvailability","verdict":"correct","target":"Limpiar disponibilidad obsoleta de {quality}","confidence":"high","reason":"'Clear Stale' is not translated; 'Limpiar disponibilidad obsoleta' is the correct and natural Spanish UI phrasing."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.clearStaleAvailabilityExplanation","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.clearStaleAvailabilityFailed","verdict":"correct","target":"No se pudo limpiar la disponibilidad obsoleta.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Incapaz de aclarar la disponibilidad' is a mistranslation. 'Clear' in this context means 'limpiar' (to clear/reset), not 'aclarar' (to clarify). 'Obsoleta' should be included to match 'stale'."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.clearStaleAvailabilitySuccess","verdict":"correct","target":"Disponibilidad obsoleta limpiada.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Se ha eliminado la disponibilidad' is ambiguous and misses 'stale'. 'Disponibilidad obsoleta limpiada' accurately reflects 'Stale availability cleared'."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.clearStaleAvailabilityTitle","verdict":"correct","target":"¿Limpiar disponibilidad obsoleta de {quality}?","confidence":"high","reason":"The target is a broken mix of English and Spanish with incorrect punctuation. '¿Limpiar disponibilidad obsoleta de {quality}?' is the correct, natural Spanish question."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.closeConfirm","verdict":"correct","target":"¿Cerrar {count, plural, one {# incidencia abierta} other {# incidencias abiertas}}?","confidence":"high","reason":"'Cerca' is a mistranslation of 'Close' (should be 'Cerrar'). 'Cuestión' is a calque of 'issue'; 'incidencia' is the standard term for software issues/tickets. The ICU plural structure was also incorrectly modified with 'many'."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.closeDescription","verdict":"correct","target":"Marca todas las incidencias abiertas actualmente para este medio como resueltas. Conserva sus comentarios e historial para que puedan ser vistos o reabiertos. Las solicitudes, las entradas de la biblioteca y los archivos multimedia no se eliminan. Las incidencias de otros medios no se modifican.","confidence":"high","reason":"The target uses 'temas' and 'problemas' inconsistently for 'issues'. 'Incidencias' is the correct term. 'Mantenga' (formal) should be 'Marca' (informal) to match the UI tone. 'Estos medios' should be 'este medio' to match the singular context of the action."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.closeIssues","verdict":"correct","target":"Cerrar incidencias abiertas","confidence":"high","reason":"'Problemas' is a calque of 'issues'; 'incidencias' is the standard term. The article 'los' is unnecessary in a UI action label."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.deleteConfirm","verdict":"correct","target":"¿Eliminar {count, plural, one {# incidencia} other {# incidencias}}?","confidence":"high","reason":"'Suprimir' is less common than 'Eliminar' for UI actions. 'Cuestión' should be 'incidencia'. The ICU plural structure was incorrectly modified with 'many'."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.deleteDescription","verdict":"correct","target":"Estas incidencias y todos sus comentarios se eliminarán permanentemente. Esta acción no se puede deshacer.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Cuestiones' should be 'incidencias'. 'Esto no puede ser deshecho' is a passive calque; 'Esta acción no se puede deshacer' is more natural."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.deleteIssues","verdict":"correct","target":"Eliminar todas las incidencias","confidence":"high","reason":"'Suprímase' is an incorrect reflexive form for a UI action label. 'Cuestiones' should be 'incidencias'. 'Eliminar' is preferred over 'Suprimir'."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.deleteRequests","verdict":"correct","target":"Eliminar solicitud","confidence":"high","reason":"'Suprimir' is less common than 'Eliminar' for UI actions. The article 'la' is unnecessary in a UI action label."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.done","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.ebook","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.explanation","verdict":"correct","target":"Eliminar solicitud cancela el trabajo de solicitud activa identificable y elimina la solicitud seleccionada y su historial.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Eliminar Solicitud' should be lowercase 'Eliminar solicitud' as it is part of a sentence. 'Historia' should be 'historial' (history/log) in this context."},{"id":"components.ManageMediaActions.failed","verdict":"correct","target":"No se pudo completar la acción. El estado se está actualizando; algunas incidencias pueden haberse actualizado ya.","confidence":"high","reason":"'La acción no puede completarse' is a passive calque; 'No se pudo completar la acción' is more natural. 'Refrescado' is a calque of 'refreshed'; 'actualizando' is the correct term. 'Cuestiones' should be 'incidencias'."}]}
